  "problem": "In a school, a survey conducted on the $40$ students shows that $17$ students traveled to school by train, $23$ students traveled by bus, and $10$ students traveled by both train and bus. \n\nIf $T$ represents the event that a student travels by train, and $B$ represents the event that a student travels by bus, which of the following diagrams gives the correct Venn diagram for the corresponding sample space?",
